<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TATU Kutubxona | Ro'yxat</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #f1f5f9; }
        .input-field { background: #f8fafc; border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 11px 16px; width: 100%; outline: none; transition: all .2s; font-size: 14px; }
        .input-field:focus { border-color: #2563eb; background: #fff; }
        .btn-primary { background: #2563eb; color: white; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; transition: all .2s; }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <%c++
        auto& csrf     = @@.get<std::string>("csrf_token");
        auto& errorMsg = @@.get<std::string>("error_msg");
    %>

    <div class="flex-grow flex items-center justify-center p-6 py-10">
        <div class="w-full max-w-lg">
            <a href="/" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-8">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-white font-black text-base shadow-lg">T</div>
                <span class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">TATU Kutubxona</span>
            </a>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-8">
                <div class="text-center mb-6">
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">Ro'yxatdan o'tish</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">Yangi o'quvchi hisobi</p>
                </div>

                <%c++ if (!errorMsg.empty()) { %>
                <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 text-sm px-4 py-3 rounded-lg mb-5 flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="mt-0.5">⚠</span>
                    <span><%c++ Register_tmp_stream << errorMsg; %></span>
                </div>
                <%c++ } %>

                <form action="/royxat" method="POST" class="space-y-4">
                    <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<%c++ Register_tmp_stream << csrf; %>">

                    <div>
                        <label class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide block mb-1.5">To'liq ism</label>
                        <input type="text" name="fullname" placeholder="Ism Familiya" required class="input-field">
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide block mb-1.5">Telefon raqam</label>
                        <input type="text" name="phone" placeholder="+998 90 123 45 67" required class="input-field">
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide block mb-1.5">Email <span class="text-slate-400 normal-case">(ixtiyoriy — bron eslatmalari uchun)</span></label>
                        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="siz@example.com" class="input-field">
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <label class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide block mb-1.5">Parol</label>
                            <input type="password" name="password" id="pwd1" placeholder="••••••••" required class="input-field">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide block mb-1.5">Parolni tasdiqlang</label>
                            <input type="password" name="password2" id="pwd2" placeholder="••••••••" required class="input-field">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-700 text-xs px-4 py-3 rounded-lg space-y-1">
                        <p>ℹ️ Ro'yxatdan o'tgach, <strong>profilingizda</strong> kerakli kutubxona uchun karta rasmini yuklang.</p>
                        <p class="text-blue-500">Har bir kutubxona uchun alohida karta tasdiqlanadi.</p>
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit" class="btn-primary w-full py-3 text-sm mt-1">Ro'yxatdan o'tish</button>
                </form>

                <div class="mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-slate-100 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">
                    Hisobingiz bormi?
                    <a href="/kirish" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:text-blue-700 ml-1">Kiring</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="py-5 text-center text-xs text-slate-300">© 2026 TATU Kutubxona</footer>
</body>
</html>
